{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE GAME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Traveller's Sight is a point-and-click FMV, a fully filmed investigative video game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was filmed in France in the Lyon and Marseille regions, as well as in Egypt, Italy, and Germany. This is unprecedented for a game of this genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SYNOPSIS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vincent Dumas, an investigator with supernatural powers, is sent to a small town in France with a dark history to uncover the truth about the death of Laur\u00e8ne Delgado.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using his ability to communicate with the dead, he sets out to find clues to track down the killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His adventure will take him much further than he could ever have imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAMEPLAY</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to characters in multiple-choice dialogues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use objects to access new locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your powers to discover supernatural beings</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3356000?t=1771413370","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356000/39e23d13b95728a03588f6222949d810deeeedba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771413370","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356000/a07d79959d22c6298ab4c3237f6dcb008e5cb3b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771413370","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356000/a07d79959d22c6298ab4c3237f6dcb008e5cb3b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771413370","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","i